+the other lanes' experts. MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 Turquoise Bay AI Pty Ltd (the MIT text above). Ash Hart
+([@ashxhart](https://x.com/ashxhart), [ashhart](https://github.com/ashhart)) authored
+[MCDMA](https://github.com/ashhart/MCDMA/tree/e672c14ff9fc7b38994caf73025cf1588b4de74e), Apache-2.0, whose link
+daemons carry the exchanges; its protocol 1 has one mailbox and one request per link, so `TF_GLM_MCDMA_INFLIGHT=N`
